  "instructions": [
    "Heat oil in a large Dutch oven over medium-high heat.",
    "Dredge beef in flour, shaking off excess.",
    "Sear beef until browned, about 5 minutes. Remove and set aside.",
    "Add more oil if necessary, then sauté onion, carrot, and mushroom until tender.",
    "Add Guinness, beef broth, and water to pot. Scrape up browned bits.",
    "Return beef to pot and bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce heat to low, cover, and simmer for 1 1/2 hours, or until beef is tender.",
    "Season with salt and pepper to taste.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with chopped fresh herbs if desired."
